    "Table TEDS with 17-page denominator uses mean of per-page means (official notebook summary); all.TEDS.all is a 24-table instance mean.",
    "Formula CDM and combined official leaderboard score were not executed. This frozen 80+20 sample is not a complete official leaderboard run.",
    "Elapsed duration is the production adapter request duration including waits/errors; wall time additionally includes restart, scheduler, and interrupted-parent gaps. Percentiles use linear interpolation at (n-1)*q.",
